     <p style="font-family: Calibri; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 108%; margin: 0px 0px 0.001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0.84in;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt; text-indent: 0.29in; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;"><strong>支部名片：</strong></span><span style="font-size: 10.5pt; text-indent: 0.29in; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">绍兴一中学科</span><span style="font-family: "Calibri Light", "sans-serif"; font-size: 10.5pt; text-indent: 0.29in; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">竞赛支部共有党员15名，</span><span style="font-family: "Calibri Light", "sans-serif"; font-size: 10.5pt; text-indent: 0.29in; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">平均年龄34岁，</span><span style="font-family: "Calibri Light", "sans-serif"; font-size: 10.5pt; text-indent: 0.29in; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">拥有全国竞赛（联赛）优秀教练称号等省级以上荣誉者</span><span style="font-family: "Calibri Light", "sans-serif"; font-size: 10.5pt; text-indent: 0.29in; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">13</span><span style="font-family: "Calibri Light", "sans-serif"; font-size: 10.5pt; text-indent: 0.29in; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">人，</span><span style="font-family: "Calibri Light", "sans-serif"; font-size: 10.5pt; text-indent: 0.29in; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">其中特级教师1人，</span><span style="font-family: "Calibri Light", "sans-serif"; font-size: 10.5pt; text-indent: 0.29in; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">高级教师</span><span style="font-family: "Calibri Light", "sans-serif"; font-size: 10.5pt; text-indent: 0.29in; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">6</span><span style="font-family: "Calibri Light", "sans-serif"; font-size: 10.5pt; text-indent: 0.29in; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">人</span><span style="font-family: "Calibri Light", "sans-serif"; font-size: 10.5pt; text-indent: 0.29in; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">，</span><span style="font-family: "Calibri Light", "sans-serif"; font-size: 10.5pt; text-indent: 0.29in; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">绍兴市学科带头人1人，绍兴市直学科带头人1人：</span><span style="font-family: "Calibri Light", "sans-serif"; font-size: 10.5pt; text-indent: 0.29in; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">是</span><span style="font-family: "Calibri Light", "sans-serif"; font-size: 10.5pt; text-indent: 0.29in; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">一支朝气蓬勃、团结奋进的先锋队伍。</span><span style="font-family: "Calibri Light", "sans-serif"; font-size: 10.5pt; text-indent: 0.29in; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">支部由范捷、沈洋铭、刘军霞三位老师组成支委会，下</span><span style="font-size: 10.5pt; text-indent: 0.29in; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">设有</span><span style="font-size: 10.5pt; text-indent: 0.29in; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">生化学科组、数物信学科组两</span><span style="font-size: 10.5pt; text-indent: 0.29in; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">个党小组</span><span style="font-family: "Calibri Light", "sans-serif"; font-size: 10.5pt; text-indent: 0.29in; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">。2021年，支部获评绍兴市先进基层党组织。</span>
</p><p style="font-family: 'Calibri Light', 'sans-serif';font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="\UploadFiles\xwzx\2022\5\202205231542023682.Png" style="width: 4.011806in; height: 2.168056in" alt="202205231542022797.Png" /></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="\UploadFiles\xwzx\2022\5\202205231542022648.Png" style="width: 4.545833in; height: 1.430556in" alt="202205231542026936.Png" /></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="\UploadFiles\xwzx\2022\5\202205231542028890.Png" style="width: 3.875695in; height: 2.232639in" alt="202205231542025716.Png" /></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0.15in;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>一、</strong></span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>贯彻落实市党代会精神，奋进“共同富裕”优质教育新征程</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0.15in;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">在《中国共产党绍兴市第九次代表大会的工作报告》中，明确提出了今后五年的奋斗目标和主要任务，对全市经济建设、政治建设、文化建设、社会建设、生态文明建设和党的建设作出全面部署，要率先走出以人为本、全面进步的共同富裕之路。通过教育发展来促进共同富裕，最重要的就是促进教育公平和提高教育质量，办人民群众满意的教育。我们要结合自身工作把党代会精神融入到立德树人、五育并举的各项教学活动中，贯彻好党代会精神。在日常工作中，我们要坚持正确的政治引领，以提高教学质量为抓手，提升支部教师队伍建设；以服务学生为宗旨，提高党员教师的敬业意识；以争先创优为动力，筑建高质量的教学，为建设共同富裕示范区贡献我们的智慧和力量。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0.15in;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">二、</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>专家引领共建竞赛课堂，探索“科技创新”人才培育新模式</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0.15in;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">    2020年我校携手中国卫星导航定位协会、北京大学成立了绍兴一中“北斗元培学苑”，形成高校与高中联合培养“高精尖人才”的新模式，我校依托“绍兴一中北大名师工作室”，逐渐形成专家引领式的“线上+线下”竞赛课堂共建，以培养科技创新人才为目标的新型竞赛学习模式。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0.36in;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.00in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">1.</span><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> 助力专家课堂，深耕竞赛教学</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0.15in;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: -0.15in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">      </span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">我校五大学科竞赛在“北斗元培学苑”的专家指导下，定期开展线上竞赛课堂。其中有：北京大学李伟固教授、</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">穆良柱</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">教授</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">、陶伟</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">教授</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">、王韬</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">教授</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，以及北京师范大学邢国文</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">教授</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">、辛明秀</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">教授</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">、梁前进</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">教授等。</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0.15in;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">面对大好资源，竞赛支部敏锐意识到这是一个提升业务能力、发挥能力作用的契机。在专家引领的线上竞赛课堂中，竞赛支部的青年教师们与学生一起听课学习，一方面不断丰富自己的专业知识储备，另一方面也及时跟进学生的学习情况，</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">为绍兴一中有志于学科竞赛的学生在竞赛道路上实现自我超越提供了充分的保障。</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 9.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;"><span style="color: #FF0000;font-size: 9.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="\UploadFiles\xwzx\2022\5\202205231542026577.Jpeg" style="width: 2.171528in; height: 1.752083in" alt="202205231542023455.Jpeg" /></span><span style="color: #FF0000;font-size: 9.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="\UploadFiles\xwzx\2022\5\202205231542025818.Jpeg" style="width: 2.1625in; height: 1.750694in" alt="202205231542028520.Jpeg" /></span><span style="color: #FF0000;font-size: 9.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="\UploadFiles\xwzx\2022\5\202205231542027928.Png" style="width: 2.205555in; height: 1.744444in" alt="202205231542029124.Png" /></span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 9.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;"><span style="color: #FF0000;font-size: 9.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 9.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;"><span style="color: #FF0000;font-size: 9.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 9.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;"><span style="color: #FF0000;font-size: 9.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 9.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;"><span style="color: #FF0000;font-size: 9.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 9.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;"><span style="color: #FF0000;font-size: 9.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 9.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;"><span style="color: #FF0000;font-size: 9.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 9.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;"><span style="color: #FF0000;font-size: 9.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 9.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;"><span style="color: #FF0000;font-size: 9.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0.36in;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.00in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">2.</span><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">倾情忘我投入，潜心竞赛辅导</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0.15in;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">我校竞赛支部的党员教师经常放弃休息时间，利用晚上、周六和节假日等时间为学生开展常态化的线下竞赛辅导。尽管日常的教学工作已经十分繁忙，但是竞赛支部的老师们都毫无怨言，尽心尽力地辅导每一位竞赛学生。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0.36in;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="\UploadFiles\xwzx\2022\5\202205231542028553.Jpeg" style="width: 1.99375in; height: 1.495833in" alt="202205231542026164.Jpeg" /></span><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="\UploadFiles\xwzx\2022\5\202205231542020360.Jpeg" style="width: 1.966667in; height: 1.501389in" alt="202205231542027849.Jpeg" /></span><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="\UploadFiles\xwzx\2022\5\202205231542023337.Jpeg" style="width: 2.020139in; height: 1.515278in" alt="202205231542021687.Jpeg" /></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0.36in;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">  </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0.15in;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: -0.15in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">      未来，我们将继续全面汇聚各方面优质资源，通过校外竞赛专家结合校内竞赛教练的辅导模式，共同努力为竞赛学生搭建多元的学习通道，夯实学科基础，为国家输送更多的科技创新人才。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">  </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0.15in;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.00in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>三、</strong></span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>锤炼队伍敢于担当作为，彰显“岗位建功”党员教师新风貌</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0.51in;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.00in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">1.</span><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">以“比武”促“教学”，优化队伍建设</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0.15in;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">新课程、新高考背景下，竞赛支部党员教师积极参加各类教学评比，提升自身专业素质，  其中沈超华老师代获得浙江省高中理科教师实验技能大赛一等奖，另外刘军霞老师、沈超华老师、金杰老师在校教科节课堂教学能力比武评比中分别获得一、二、三等奖。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0.51in;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="\UploadFiles\xwzx\2022\5\202205231542026533.Jpeg" style="width: 1.768056in; height: 2.563889in" alt="202205231542025366.Jpeg" /></span><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="\Upl