-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="\UploadFiles\xwzx\2022\5\202205231542021442.Png" style="width: 2.503472in; height: 1.802778in" alt="202205231542025131.Png" /></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0.51in;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0.51in;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0.51in;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0.51in;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0.51in;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0.51in;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0.51in;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0.51in;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">                                </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">在促进共同富裕的大背景下，首要的是提升教学质量，如何提升教学质量？离不开好的教师队伍，为此我们不但通过教学比武激发教师的教学质量意识，提升竞赛支部青年教师的专业技能水平，同时也进一步规范党组织生活，发挥党员教师的先锋模范作用，把竞赛支部打造成政治素养和教学业务素养双带头的教师队伍。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0.51in;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">2.</span><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">以服务明宗旨，强化育人意识</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">（1）征集学生建议， 为服务竞赛学生找准“切口”</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="\UploadFiles\xwzx\2022\5\202205231542029872.Jpeg" style="width: 2.375in; height: 3.4125in" alt="202205231542027885.Jpeg" /></span><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="\UploadFiles\xwzx\2022\5\202205231542024108.Jpeg" style="width: 2.51875in; height: 3.336806in" alt="202205231542025173.Jpeg" /></span><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="\UploadFiles\xwzx\2022\5\202205231542020643.Jpeg" style="width: 2.543056in; height: 3.477778in" alt="202205231542027675.Jpeg" /></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="\UploadFiles\xwzx\2022\5\202205231542022126.Jpeg" style="width: 2.335417in; height: 3.255556in" alt="202205231542025914.Jpeg" /></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">通过对调查意见的梳理，我们找出学生在竞赛学习中存在的困难，如：难以将高考与竞赛平衡，需要更灵活的课程安排；二试难度难以突破，自信心不足；知识体系不够完整，解题不够熟练等等。在找到这些存在的问题后，我们将联合教学处共同商讨，针对不同的学生制定个性化竞赛辅导方案，及时沟通学生存在的问题等，为学生们一一解决存在的问题，进一步提升竞赛辅导的质量。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">（2）开展强基课堂，助力高三学子守梦想</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">为帮助高三学子实现升学的美好梦想，竞赛支部的季潮丞老师经常利用晚上的时间，不计得失、孜孜不倦地为高三的学生开展数学强基课程，为有志于“双一流”高校基础学科研究的顶尖学子保驾护航。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="\UploadFiles\xwzx\2022\5\202205231542024221.Jpeg" style="width: 3.8in; height: 2.850694in" alt="202205231542023671.Jpeg" /></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">   </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong> </strong></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong> </strong></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong> </strong></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong> </strong></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong> </strong></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong> </strong></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong> </strong></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong> </strong></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong> </strong></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong> </strong></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0.22in;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0.22in;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">在学校竞赛管理的重点培育下，在多位国际金牌教练的引领带动下，竞赛支部的全体教师正以学校竞赛主力军的姿态，围绕中心，服务大局，不断助推学校学科竞赛全面开花。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0.22in;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">“潮平两岸阔，风正一帆悬。”朝气蓬勃的竞赛支部，正乘着“窗口建设”的东风，以学校推进创新人才精英培养为新起点，秉持市第九次党代会精神，用坚守和奉献践行教育初心，锐意进取，不断创新，谱写教育新征程上的“共同富裕”新篇章！</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0.22in;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0.22in;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0.22in;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0.22in;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style=